[2026-05-26T15:37:23.301Z] [INFO] {"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_346","type":"reasoning","text":"**Checking CI status**\n\nI need to check the CI runs, but first, I want to ensure the status is clean, especially looking at the temporary files in /tmp. My plan is to run `git status --short` to get the current SHA. After that, I'll use `gh run list` to get a detailed protocol, listing recent runs with their timestamps. I’ll verify against the latest commit and download logs for any non-passing runs. If runs are still in progress, there won’t be any logs available."}}
